  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/12/AinFestesSantAmbros6a8.png\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 329px;\" /></p>\n<p>A&iacute;n, al bell mig de la Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave;, es troba immersa en les festes de Sant Ambr&oacute;s, que duraran fins aquest diumenge 8 de desembre.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/12/IMG_3678.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest divendres 6, com &eacute;s tradicional, s&#39;han fet les calderes,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/12/IMG_3699.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>seguides de l&#39;actuaci&oacute; de Gustavo Parad&iacute;s al Centre Cultural.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3678.jpg\" alt=\"img_3678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3679.jpg\" alt=\"img_3679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3680.jpg\" alt=\"img_3680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3681.jpg\" alt=\"img_3681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3682.jpg\" alt=\"img_3682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3683.jpg\" alt=\"img_3683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/calederessantambosain2019/img_3685.jpg\" alt=\"img_3685\" style=\"max-width:100%;h